Carry the accepted-token source indices from the attention metadata into the
GDN and causal-conv1d kernels, so a speculative step can recover the recurrent
state from the row it was actually written to rather than from the row its
sequential position implies.

The kernels gain a num_accepted_tokens pointer, which may be None, and an
IS_SPEC_DECODING constexpr that compiles the lookup away when it is not.

